# UniswapV2ERC20.transfer from every caller: the statement

The published claim, stated without the proof. It imports the generic statement
(`Verify.Generic.Expected`), SolidCore's import of solc's AST of the flattened port
(`Contracts.UniswapV2.ERC20.Source`, generated by `scripts/verify/uniswap_v2_sources.py` through
